exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gambling-agc-new 1`] = `
"GAMBLING ACT 2005
Notice of Application for a Premises Licence

Sample Gaming Ltd of 2 Casino Way, Sampleton, LS1 1AA has applied to Sample Licensing Authority for a new of a adult gaming centre premises licence at Sample Betting Shop, 12 Market Street, Sampleton, LS1 1AA.

The application seeks authorisation for the following:
• Betting on sporting events
• Provision of gaming machines

Representations may be made in writing to the Licensing Authority at Town Hall, Sampleton, LS1 2BB or by email to licensing@sample.gov.uk no later than 23 October 2025.
The application may be inspected at the offices of the Licensing Authority during normal working hours.

Dated: 25 September 2025."
`;

