exports[`Notice template renderers > renders gvol-new 1`] = `
"GOODS VEHICLE OPERATOR’S LICENCE

Sample Haulage Ltd of Logistics House, Manchester, M1 1AA is applying to the Traffic Commissioner for North Western Traffic Area for a new of an Operator’s Licence at Unit 5 Industrial Estate, Manchester, M1 1AA to keep:
• 6 goods vehicles and 4 trailers.

Owners or occupiers of land (including buildings) near the operating centre who believe that their use or enjoyment of that land would be affected may make representations in writing to: Hillcrest House, 386 Harehills Lane, Leeds LS9 6NF, by 30 October 2025.
A copy of the representations must at the same time be sent to Sample Haulage Ltd at the address given above.

Dated: 25 September 2025."
`;

