exports[`Notice template renderers > renders licensing-club-new 1`] = `
"LICENSING ACT 2003
Application for a Club Premises Certificate

Sample Bars Ltd of 1 Demo Road, Sampleton, SW1A 1AA has applied to Sample Borough Council for a Club Premises Certificate at Sample Venue, 10 High Street, Sampleton, SW1A 1AA.

The application seeks authorisation for the following qualifying club activities:
• Alcohol (on sales)

Proposed hours of operation are:
• Alcohol (on sales): Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri, Sat — 10:00 to 23:00

Club activities restricted to members and bona fide guests.

Representations may be made representations in writing to Civic Centre, Sampleton, AB1 2CD or by email to licensing@sample.gov.uk no later than 23 October 2025.
The application may be inspected at Civic Centre, Sampleton.
It is an offence under Section 158 of the Licensing Act 2003 to knowingly or recklessly make a false statement in connection with an application. The maximum fine on summary conviction is unlimited.
Dated: 25 September 2025."
`;

exports[`Notice template renderers > renders licensing-club-review 1`] = `
"LICENSING ACT 2003
Application for the Review of a Club Premises Certificate

Sample Bars Ltd has applied to Sample Borough Council for a review of the Club Premises Certificate for Sample Venue, 10 High Street, Sampleton, SW1A 1AA on the grounds of:

Alleged failure to uphold the prevention of nuisance licensing objective.

Any responsible authority or other person may make representations as detailed below.
Representations may be made representations in writing to Civic Centre, Sampleton, AB1 2CD or by email to licensing@sample.gov.uk no later than 23 October 2025.
The application may be inspected at Civic Centre, Sampleton.
It is an offence under Section 158 of the Licensing Act 2003 to knowingly or recklessly make a false statement in connection with an application. The maximum fine on summary conviction is unlimited.
Dated: 25 September 2025."
`;

exports[`Notice template renderers > renders licensing-club-variation 1`] = `
"LICENSING ACT 2003
Application to Vary a Club Premises Certificate

Sample Bars Ltd of 1 Demo Road, Sampleton, SW1A 1AA has applied to Sample Borough Council to vary the Club Premises Certificate for Sample Venue, 10 High Street, Sampleton, SW1A 1AA as follows:

Extend alcohol sales to 01:00 daily.

Existing permitted club activities and hours remain unless varied above.
Representations may be made representations in writing to Civic Centre, Sampleton, AB1 2CD or by email to licensing@sample.gov.uk no later than 23 October 2025.
The application may be inspected at Civic Centre, Sampleton.
It is an offence under Section 158 of the Licensing Act 2003 to knowingly or recklessly make a false statement in connection with an application. The maximum fine on summary conviction is unlimited.
Dated: 25 September 2025."
`;

