exports[`Notice template renderers > renders planning-conservation 1`] = `
"TOWN AND COUNTRY PLANNING ACTS

Sample City Council has received the following application:
Reference: SCC/2025/1234. Site: Riverside Way, Sample City, EC1A 1BB.
Proposal: Construction of a mixed-use development comprising 80 dwellings, retail space, and public realm improvements..
Reason for press notice:
• Major development - 10 or more dwellings

The application and plans may be inspected at Civic Offices, Sample City during normal office hours.
Representations must be submitted by 25 October 2025 via https://planning.sample.gov.uk/applications/123456 or in writing to Civic Offices, Sample City, EC1A 2CC.

Dated: 25 September 2025."
`;

